sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SCH as Scheduler (Auction Service)
  participant AS as Auction Service
  participant R as Redis
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant VS as Vehicle Service
  participant WS as WebSocket Gateway
  actor W as Winner
  actor M as Gallery Manager
  SCH->>AS: tick: endsAt reached for auction {id}
  AS->>R: EVALSHA close_auction.lua (lock room, read final state)
  R-->>AS: highest bid, bidder, sequence no.
  alt highest ≥ reserve
    AS->>PG: transaction: UPDATE auctions SET status=SOLD + INSERT sales
    AS->>VS: vehicle status → SOLD
    AS->>WS: AUCTION_CLOSED {result: SOLD}
    WS-->>W: You won – hand-over PDF link
    WS-->>M: Vehicle sold for final price
  else no bid or below reserve
    AS->>PG: UPDATE auctions SET status=NOT_SOLD
    AS->>VS: vehicle status → IN_STOCK
    AS->>WS: AUCTION_CLOSED {result: NOT_SOLD}
    WS-->>M: Reserve not met – relist?
  end
  AS->>R: DEL auction:{id}:* (after 24 h TTL)
